            "text": "<p>Send us your measurements, photos or drawings and we will prepare a detailed quote for your California project. Order standard panels and hardware online, or ask about custom sizes. Call or text (855) 452-7715, Monday to Friday, 8 AM to 5 PM Eastern, or use the <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact page</a>. Not sure about the finish? Order the glass and hardware sample kit first.</p>"
