        "heading": "Need an installer in California?",
        "text": "<p>The system is designed for do-it-yourself installation with our guide and videos; most standard installations take about 4 hours. We may have an installer in your area: contact us with your project address and we will check.</p>",
        "button_label": "Send your project address",
